/Title (UTWind recycles discarded PET bottles into 3D printing filament for turbine prototyping. This project reduces plastic waste, promotes circular manufacturing, and gives students hands-on sustainable engineering experience. Your support will help expand the initiative and fund the equipment needed to transform campus waste into materials for renewable energy design.)
